  "description_mirror": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "At December's meetup, we'll be hearing talks from you! You can talk about anything Ruby, Rails, or tech related. If you have an idea but not sure if it's good enough for a talk…it is! We have space for 2 or 3 talks.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Lineup",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Rosanna Speller - What time is it? ",
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "This talk will guide you through dealing with dates, times, and time zones in Rails.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Gary Moore - Comparing traditional Machine Learning with LLM performance when evaluating Privacy Policies ",
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "While this talk isn't directly Ruby/Rails related, it'll be an interesting way to look at AI.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Matt Scilipoti - A guide to working in dev containers ",
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Another less Rails specific talk, but another good one! Learn how to use containers to manage running different dependencies/projects on your machine.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Please drop us a message if you'd like to give a talk at a future meetup.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
